==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elephantidae Papaou]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**2 [[Le'boin]]s spawn, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Ancient Magamojoe]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use Can Can to farm money off the Doge Dark at the start, do not over-upgrade your wallet (level 4 should be enough) and prepare to take out the first Ragin' Gory. Elephantidae spawns on base hit, serving as a backliner to cripple your meatshields. After some time Magamojoe spawns, and this is your cue to send out your anti-Relic units.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]] - Can [[Weaken]] Magamojoe using the other enemies as stepping stones.
*[[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]] - Can [[Freeze]] Magamojoe, while dealing chip damage to the other Behemoth enemies present.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Destiny Phonoa]] - Outranges all the threats of the stage, while dealing heavy damage to Ragin' Gory and sniping Magamojoe.
*Talented [[Sharpshooter Saki (Uber Rare Cat)|Bad Blaster Saki]] - Similar to Phonoa, being a [[Strong]] sniper that can deal well against Magamojoe.
*[[Daybreaker Izanagi (Legend Rare Cat)|Dawnbringer Izanagi]] - Deals [[Insane Damage]] to all traits, countering all enemies but the dual elephants.
*[[Izanami of Dusk (Legend Rare Cat)|Izanami of Eventide]] - Rather than traited enemies, Izanami deals Insane Damage to traitless enemies, which are quite abundant in this stage. Furthermore, Izanami has [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]] whereas Izanagi lacks it, meaning Izanami tends to live slightly longer.
*[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]]: Outranges every threat by a mile and tears through peons with a level 10 wave, be sure to protect him though, because he's very fragile and could be gone in the blink of an eye, but his range and damage more than makes up for that.

